            "The operation used a digitally altered photograph of Ursula von der Leyen casting a ballot, edited to show tomato-throwing. DFRLab documents no deepfake or synthetic video or audio in this campaign — the manipulation was a doctored still and a fake news-outlet attribution, which is worth noting against the assumption that influence operations have moved wholesale to generative video.",
