          "host": "B",
          "text": "Anthropic's Frontier Red Team tested Zhipu's open-weight GLM-5.3 on exploit development. It built end-to-end exploits in 50 of 410 attempts. Anthropic's own Claude Mythos Preview did it in 56 of 410."
