          "text": "Caveat, and it's a real one. This is one frontier lab evaluating a competitor's model on its own benchmarks, so it's a company claim, not independently verified, and Anthropic has a commercial and policy interest in the comparison. Anthropic's stated conclusion is that GLM-5.3 is a meaningful step change in the cyber capabilities available to attackers."
