            "CNBC says OpenAI also launched a Pro tier called Pro 500 carrying \"the company's highest usage allowance\", and a premium speed tier, Ultrafast, that \"generates tokens up to eight times faster in Codex and up to six times faster in the API\". VentureBeat puts Ultrafast at up to 300 tokens per second at 6X standard API pricing.",
